      "text": "thou shalt not commit adultery, Mosiah 13:22. priests preach against adultery, Alma 16:18. Lamanite king teaches people not to commit adultery, Alma 23:3. those who commit adultery are punished, Alma 30:10. adultery is most abominable above all sins save murder and denying the Holy Ghost, Alma 39:3–5. slaughter of Nephites caused by committing adultery, Hel. 4:11–12. Nephites rule that they might more easily commit adultery, Hel. 7:5. whoso lusts after woman has already committed adultery in heart, 3 Ne. 12:28 (Matt. 5:28). whoso puts away his wife causes her to commit adultery, 3 Ne. 12:32 (Matt. 5:32).",
