    {
      "text": "cleave unto thy wife and none else, D&C 42:22. he who lusts after woman denies faith, shall not have the Spirit, D&C 42:23 (63:16). thou shalt not commit adultery, D&C 42:24 (59:6; 66:10). those who commit adultery and repent not shall be cast out, D&C 42:24 (59:6). repentant adulterer to be forgiven, D&C 42:25–26. those who leave companions for sake of adultery shall be cast out, D&C 42:74–75. those who commit adultery are to be tried by elders, D&C 42:80. deal with adulterers according to law of God, D&C 42:80–83. some adulterers among members, D&C 63:14. works of adulterers to follow them in eyes of people, D&C 63:15. adulterers to inherit telestial glory, D&C 76:103. instructions concerning those who have entered covenant of eternal marriage, D&C 132:41–45.",
